# Sienna design

This is a quiet photo atelier, not a SaaS dashboard. Cream paper, espresso ink, brass accents.

## Palette (use tokens, never raw hex in components)

- Page: `bg-cream-50`, text `text-ink`
- Surfaces: `bg-cream-50` / `bg-cream-100` with `border-cream-300`
- Primary actions: `bg-espresso` / `text-cream-50`
- Secondary text: `text-cocoa`; italic display accents: `text-umber`
- Warm highlight: `caramel`; errors: `terracotta`; rare gold: `brass`
- Shadows: `shadow-paper`, hover `shadow-lift` (brown-tinted, never gray)

## Type

- UI / body: `font-sans` (Outfit)
- Headlines: `font-display` (Fraunces). Italic Fraunces for one lyrical line, not whole paragraphs
- Eyebrows: 11px, uppercase, wide tracking (`tracking-[0.18em]`–`tracking-[0.28em]`), `text-cocoa`

## Shape and motion

- Cards: `rounded-[1.75rem]`–`rounded-[2rem]`, `border-cream-300`, `shadow-paper`
- Buttons and chips: `rounded-full`
- Focus: `ring-caramel/70` with `ring-offset-cream-50`
- No cool gray, no blue links, no purple gradients, no Inter/Roboto, no heavy drop shadows

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="rounded-md bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xl">
  <h1 className="font-sans font-bold">Convert files</h1>
</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<section className="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-cream-300 bg-cream-50 shadow-paper">
  <p className="text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] text-cocoa uppercase">Convert</p>
  <h1 className="font-display text-4xl text-ink">Drop a photograph.</h1>
</section>
```
